# pnpm settings for Pi Work.
#
# Unlike npm, pnpm does not treat NODE_ENV=production as "omit devDependencies":
# `pnpm install` always installs devDependencies unless `--prod` is passed
# explicitly. So the npm-era `production=false` workaround that used to live
# here was dropped when this repo moved to pnpm. (The hazard it guarded against
# is real: without devDependencies, `next build` fails because the `@/*`
# tsconfig path alias is never registered. See AGENTS.md.)
#
# Repo-wide pnpm settings live in pnpm-workspace.yaml (that is their home since
# pnpm 11): dependency build scripts, ignored platform packages, hoisting.
# This file is kept for registry/auth configuration only.
